{"Date": "10/02/2018", "Permit Number": "B2018-03930", "Project Name": "Electrical Mechanical Plumbing Permit", "Status": "Finaled", "Address": "2126 ACTON St, BERKELEY CA 94702", "Action": "", "Description": "In reference to Notice of Investigation, Housing & Code Enforcement Case #H2018-00185. Item 13 - Water heater was improperly installed. Drain pan and drain line are missing, exhaust venting needs to be secured. Item 15- Electrical repairs to circuit breakers Item 16 - Legalize installation of clothes washer and dryer in utility room. This includes gas line alterations, electrical power, dryer vent to exterior, hot and cold water lines, and drain for clothes washer. The machines are installed in an open room (utility room off of the Kitchen adjacent to the water heater). No changes to walls, structure, or windows. Remove washer dryer hook up in mechanical room Item 21 - Repairs to existing main electrical panel to bring it up to code", "_cells": ["", "10/02/2018", "B2018-03930", "Electrical Mechanical Plumbing Permit", "Finaled", "2126 ACTON St, BERKELEY CA 94702", "", "In reference to Notice of Investigation, Housing & Code Enforcement Case #H2018-00185. Item 13 - Water heater was improperly installed. Drain pan and drain line are missing, exhaust venting needs to be secured. Item 15- Electrical repairs to circuit breakers Item 16 - Legalize installation of clothes washer and dryer in utility room. This includes gas line alterations, electrical power, dryer vent to exterior, hot and cold water lines, and drain for clothes washer. The machines are installed in an open room (utility room off of the Kitchen adjacent to the water heater). No changes to walls, structure, or windows. Remove washer dryer hook up in mechanical room Item 21 - Repairs to existing main electrical panel to bring it up to code", "2126 ACTON St, BERKELEY CA 94702"], "capdetail_href": "/BERKELEY/Cap/CapDetail.aspx?Module=Building&TabName=Building&capID1=DUB18&capID2=00000&capID3=00HSC&agencyCode=BERKELEY&IsToShowInspection="}
